[{"client_msg_id":"8f944215-16d2-4843-afa5-ebeaa2ac627b","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"レギュラーゲストで毎回おもしろい話してくれてますよー","ts":"1624351288.321300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]},{"name":"shiro-ohoo","count":1,"users":["U7CJ2P52B"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fd28"}]},{"client_msg_id":"343bdce3-9e17-4d9e-8090-b8293cd62ddd","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"お、このポッドキャスト知らなかったです。t-wadaさんの回がいっぱい!","ts":"1624351086.320800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S2X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5043861-9b7e-4a82-a7e8-249d351bcb59","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"マイクロサービスシルバーブレッド教についてはリーンとdebopsの科学の文脈で導入しないと絵に書いた餅になってしまうんだろうなーってこれ聞いて思いました。\n\u003chttps://anchor.fm/textafm/episodes/5--Accelerate-ethnjo/a-a52cmsg\u003e","ts":"1624350511.320400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Anchor: 5. Accelerate by texta.fm • A podcast on Anchor","id":1,"title":"5. Accelerate by texta.fm • A podcast on Anchor","title_link":"https://anchor.fm/textafm/episodes/5--Accelerate-ethnjo/a-a52cmsg","text":"技術顧問の和田卓人さんと、LeanとDevOpsの科学（原題: Accelerate）について話しました。 Show Notes: ピクスタ技術ブログ「てくすた」 パーフェクトRuby on Rails【増補改訂版】 LeanとDevOpsの科学 Accelerate Nicole Forsgren Jez Humble（「Continuous Delivery」「The DevOps Handbook」などの著者） Gene Kim（「The DevOps Handbook」などの著者） The Lean Startup ヘロヘロScrum Jolt Awards Jolt Awards の 22年（受賞本リスト） Dr. Dobb's Journal ITエンジニア本大賞2021 DORA joins Google Cloud 2020 State of DevOps Report ajitofm 42: You must unlearn what you have learned 質とスピード（2020秋100分拡大版） 組織にテストを書く文化を根付かせる戦略と戦術（2020秋版） ブランド・エクイティ Agile \u0026amp; Lean Metrics: Cycle Time d/d/d DevOps tech: Trunk-based development Feature toggle フロー効率性とリソース効率性について XP祭り2017で発表してきた #xpjug 稼働率100%をねらってはいけない Mob Programming – A Whole Team Approach by Woody Zuill Inner source Why Software Is Eating the World CTOとして招聘されて1年でDX Criteriaを大幅改善するために追求した唯一の成果指標 DX Criteria","image_url":"https://d3t3ozftmdmh3i.cloudfront.net/production/podcast_uploaded_nologo400/8463314/8463314-1598489534691-3b3d7a8d69d8c.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Anchor","service_icon":"https://d12xoj7p9moygp.cloudfront.net/favicon/apple-touch-icon-wave-57x57.png","from_url":"https://anchor.fm/textafm/episodes/5--Accelerate-ethnjo/a-a52cmsg","original_url":"https://anchor.fm/textafm/episodes/5--Accelerate-ethnjo/a-a52cmsg"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UA1GWETAA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rjqxO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc9fa75b-3e70-405d-bfa7-8ec21fd0ecca","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ローカルでテストを回すたびに webpack が走ってうざいのは esbuild に乗り換えられると解消したりするんだろうか","ts":"1624350367.319300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"biw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"267f9f4b-5cd4-45eb-aae9-72626bef565e","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"地道な改善続けていれば解消するよねってケースは結構あるんですよね。単純にUT書いてないないし書けないようになってるとか。なぜかデプロイしないと動作確認できないとか。修正と確認のサイクルが阻害されていたりするので、それを解消するだけで結構変わるんじゃと。","ts":"1624350293.318600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NMR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec6c67ed-fec6-4f8f-8626-4f421a5813fb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"7年運営できている時点で実は結構すごい","ts":"1624348702.316200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kzk","count":2,"users":["U7CJ2P52B","U7JL1UKKL"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0KA4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee4acbe5-132b-446d-aa50-06cb02811588","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ろくに開発できなくなって7年くらい経ってそうなプロダクトを開発しています","ts":"1624348604.315000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","UDDCM376D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CGS/q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b9e4724-fe8d-482b-8dfe-99519b0b84e7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあでもこのまま突き進むといずれ機能開発すらろくにできなくなるよってパターンは実際にはあるよね","ts":"1624348537.313600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U7CJ2P52B"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GszR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b15d961d-38db-4690-8cdc-0495e6098dfb","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"株主とか利害関係者向けのアピールで要らん仕事を増やすのはある。ブルシットジョブとして定式化された。","ts":"1624348428.312900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nYqV9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e00182c0-f3c9-4c09-a845-7df204637b71","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"人類なんでも銀の弾作って教義にしてしまうな… \u0026gt; マイクロサービスシルバーブレッド教","ts":"1624348358.311700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NvR+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"837955aa-1cf4-45ef-a7e4-c53f615c4a48","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ゲーム作ってると機能開発・改修だけでクソ忙しいので、負債の返却と称していろんな取り組みしてる人は暇で羨ましいな…と思う","ts":"1624348319.310900","edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1624348333.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HqlD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c51be446-1dc9-4900-b8bb-e2555095478b","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"マイクロサービスシルバーブレッド教を見つけては、それ本当に必要を説いて回るのに疲れてしまった。","ts":"1624348013.310100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":3,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U7CJ2P52B","UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+35X7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00a26bac-d22c-41c7-9543-62bdda105c72","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"世の中のシステム刷新って結構やる必要ある？というのがたくさんあって技術者が楽しく仕事をしたいがために不必要なシステム刷新を立上てるかどうかのチェックはもうちょい厳しくてもいいんじゃないかと思ったり。特にシステム刷新のときにデータベースをいじらずに表側のサーバだけを細かく分割するケースはむやみにDBへの依存先を増やしてかえって問題を多くする危険性が高くて。","ts":"1624347905.309100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xou"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U014M3YCYAD","text":"\u003c@U014M3YCYAD\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624341250.305100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"68866841-e279-4c2a-ac25-dd6560c6a821","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"正直、触らなくて済むなら触らずに…といってると物凄い「利子」を生みそう。ていうか生みます。","ts":"1624340324.303400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"976qC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af129b92-0ba1-4d40-8793-b2e8d6a966f2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私でさえいじりたくない","ts":"1624340116.299700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/kV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"718ce276-43e8-4b75-9ad5-7fa820371d5b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"データベースはきつい","ts":"1624340110.299400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ma/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bc4cbfd-ebce-4641-bc4e-1f0cd13c3445","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"おっしゃる通りです。色々足りてないなぁ自分、と","ts":"1624339800.299000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6qVA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8578357-9231-4246-8b45-c49166b6d288","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"まずリスクを取ってでも取りたいメリット提示できるところまで行かないと話進まないのは\n新しい事すすめる上であるあるだからな・・・\nそれが出来てはじめてデメリット云々の話か","ts":"1624339706.297700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U7CJ2P52B"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8g9m+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8eed44bf-4db9-46f6-8a8b-0a4ea7040ec4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"メリット、デメリット、今後の展望、を踏まえて納得させられれば、通りそう","ts":"1624339470.296000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LGG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbe3ac7c-8e9f-40de-8dd3-7c4636196d95","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"リスクを覆すメリットが提示できなきゃ通りませんよ。特に仕事では。","ts":"1624338978.295300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4lkSW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9cfce29-a587-4682-9f23-d4d5bb13ef92","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"リスク取りたくない心理もあると思います。","ts":"1624338637.294700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z=Do"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebabae1a-6047-465b-a0ca-b4e43faf6289","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"往々にして具体的なメリットが提示できていない(納得を得られる説明ができていない)ってことでは。","ts":"1624338596.294200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uJdwh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f4554ad-1edf-4261-85e6-b9cba3ca01f5","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"データベースのリファクタの提案が全然通らない今日この頃です","ts":"1624338396.293000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Q4L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4c26692-9c99-456e-aed7-2fce689aad62","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"スピーカーの話が良かったらいいねしよう！\nのところ、「原トリ」さんの他の記事が見れるのかと思って、名前のところをクリックしたら「いいね」されて驚きました。\n「いいね」を取り消そうと思ってもう一度クリックしたら、さらに「いいね」されてさらに驚きました。\nリロードしてもちゃんと反映されてるように見えるし。。このシステムすごいな。","ts":"1624336256.292100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V7dR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b756a3bf-d77a-48a0-b1a6-e517cbde569b","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"そこに仕様整理して少しずつ新しく作り直す方が安いかまでの検討入れると死ぬ","ts":"1624335751.291700","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1624335784.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lwXcf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23ea2112-cc63-40af-898c-c2cd116643ec","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"verocity が下がっている理由がコードベースなのかそれ以外の理由なのかとか、収集すべきメトリクスが揃ってないと厳しいか","ts":"1624334260.290800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xnO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10591d05-3106-4c28-9318-113bac7655d8","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あと日頃の行いとか組織文化も大事ですね\n普段から「サービス観点と技術観点を織り込んで考えてるやつだな」と思われてれば、「これは本当にダメなので直したい」ってときに通りやすい","ts":"1624332005.287600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MaqtR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f424e876-4b56-4f99-897c-661c5ecda16a","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"リファクタに工数かけて請求上げますよって時に、「よからぬ気配がするから（バッドスメル）」だけじゃ経営や利用者は納得せんですよ。","ts":"1624331458.286500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":4,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","UL6CFN8NR","U9S4G0LJW","UFUD1LS14"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4IO+m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc178d9b-d8d3-4261-b2e4-ffde898ed382","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"技術的負債が組織におけるボトルネックなら勿論解消すべきだけど、\n「イケてない」って感覚が技術者のタダの独り善がりの可能性もあるので、難しい","ts":"1624330757.283000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U8R597E9H","U7CJ2P52B","U011FTGJ3SN","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1HKt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"440dd3bc-6122-40c3-8d89-d692aa68d5fa","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"\u003chttps://logmi.jp/tech/articles/324486?s=09|https://logmi.jp/tech/articles/324486?s=09\u003e","ts":"1624329928.282300","attachments":[{"fallback":"ログミーTech: 組織の技術的負債の返済はなぜ進まないのか？　“工数確保の合意”に関わる意思決定層と現場視点の違い","id":1,"title":"組織の技術的負債の返済はなぜ進まないのか？　“工数確保の合意”に関わる意思決定層と現場視点の違い","title_link":"https://logmi.jp/tech/articles/324486?s=09","text":"クラウドネイティブ技術を日本にも浸透させることを目的に開催された「CLOUDNATIVE DAYS Spring 2021 ONLINE」。ここで原氏が「技術的負債とステークホルダーと説明責任と」をテーマに登壇。まずは、技術的負債とは何か、組織における技術的負債返済までの構図について紹介します。","image_url":"https://img.logmi.jp/article_images/PnUPvrtjYN7PNW53oNu4RJ.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"ログミーTech","service_icon":"https://logmi.jp/img/icons/logmi-tech.png","from_url":"https://logmi.jp/tech/articles/324486?s=09","original_url":"https://logmi.jp/tech/articles/324486?s=09"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kWI4X"}]}]
